@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Packaged Catalogue and Persistent Plugin Registry
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
[CommandLineArgumentsProcessor] as CLI
[ClasspathPluginRegistry
registration catalogue] as Catalogue
[index.properties + packaged definitions] as Packaged
[PropertiesFileConfigurationPropertiesSource] as External
[JdbcPluginRegistry
authoritative lifecycle registry] as Registry
[core.plugin_registry] as RegistryTable
[core.plugin_property] as PropertyTable
[PluginSelectionResolver] as Selection
[PropertiesPluginDefinitionLoader] as Loader
[ReflectionPluginFactory] as Factory

CLI --> Catalogue : register without --file
Catalogue --> Packaged
CLI --> External : register one named --file
Catalogue --> Registry : selected registration
External --> Registry : selected registration
Registry --> RegistryTable
Registry --> PropertyTable
CLI --> Registry : list/enable/disable/unregister/run
Registry --> Selection : enabled descriptors
PropertyTable --> Loader
Selection --> Factory
Loader --> Factory
note right of Registry
Re-registration preserves current enabled status.
First registration uses plugin.enabled.
end note
@enduml
